    "Name": "Gargoyle -- Man O' War",
    "Details": "The Gargoyle is an extremely fast assault OmniMech developed with the Timber Wolf as replacements for the first-generation of OmniMechs. The Gargoyle is capable of reaching ground speeds of up to 86.4 km/h thanks to its massive 400 XL Engine. A dedicated close combat configuration, the Gargoyle C carries as its primary weapon a powerful Ultra Autocannon/20 that has twice the rate of fire as a standard Autocannon. This is supported by a brace of five ER Medium Lasers that make the 'Mech a highly effective brawler. To protect itself from infantry knee-capping attacks in an urban environment, the 'Mech has two Anti-Personnel Pods.",
